  "nodes": [
    {
      "context": "# Hansen GFC v1.12 (global_forest_change_2024_v1_12)\n\nDirect forest cover and annual loss baseline; weak supervision only for monthly tasks.\n\nPrimary v1 baseline. treecover2000 + lossyear + datamask bands. Annual labels; not suitable as monthly ground truth (see ADR 0004). v3 potential as weak supervision signal.\n\nInventory access routes are historical assessments; select and verify provider, version, coverage and access at planning time. Individual scenes are excluded.",
      "id": "DS-0001",
      "path": "knowledge/datasets/DS-0001.md",
      "review_after": "2027-04-06",
      "sources": [
        "research/data_sources/inventory.csv"
      ],
      "status": "active",
      "title": "Hansen GFC v1.12 (global_forest_change_2024_v1_12)",
      "type": "dataset",
      "updated": "2026-10-06",
      "version": "1.0"
    },
    {
      "context": "# Sentinel-2 MSI L2A\n\nHigh-resolution optical signal for forest state and disturbance confirmation.\n\nCore v2 input. 10 m optical. Cloud masking required. Monthly compositing with SCL or s2cloudless. v3: usable as input to weakly supervised model.\n\nInventory access routes are historical assessments; select and verify provider, version, coverage and access at planning time. Individual scenes are excluded. NDVI is derived from reflectance bands, not asserted to be a native dataset band.",
      "id": "DS-0002",
      "path": "knowledge/datasets/DS-0002.md",
      "review_after": "2027-04-06",
      "sources": [
        "research/data_sources/inventory.csv"
      ],
      "status": "active",
      "title": "Sentinel-2 MSI L2A",
      "type": "dataset",
      "updated": "2026-10-06",
      "version": "1.0"
    },
    {
      "context": "# Sentinel-1 GRD (C-band SAR)\n\nCloud-robust SAR signal for forest structure and monthly disturbance confirmation.\n\nCloud-robust v2 complement to Sentinel-2. VV+VH polarizations. Requires speckle filtering and terrain correction. Backscatter sensitive to moisture and structure.\n\nInventory access routes are historical assessments; select and verify provider, version, coverage and access at planning time. Individual scenes are excluded.",
      "id": "DS-0003",
      "path": "knowledge/datasets/DS-0003.md",
      "review_after": "2027-04-06",
      "sources": [
        "research/data_sources/inventory.csv"
      ],
      "status": "active",
      "title": "Sentinel-1 GRD (C-band SAR)",
      "type": "dataset",
      "updated": "2026-10-06",
      "version": "1.0"
    },
    {
